    message_edit: Handle visibility policies for partial moves.
    
    We previously updated topic visibility policies only when all
    the messages from a topic is moved.
    
    However, when only a subset of messages are moved (partial move),
    we should only update policies for users who are participants of
    the moved messages. We remove the visibility policy of orig_topic
    in case of full move, but in case of partial move we should not do it.
    
    This commit adds a filter and also a condition to not touch the
    visibility policy of the orig_topic when updating the visibility
    policies on partial move.
    
    Fixes #35224.

